---
description: Built-in and interpreter registration rules
globs: MaldaLang/BuiltIns/**/*.cs,MaldaLang/Interpreter/**/*.cs
alwaysApply: false
---

# Built-ins / interpreter

- Implement builtin logic under `MaldaLang/BuiltIns/` (often `BuiltInFunctions.cs`).
- Register in both `CallBuiltIn` and `CallBuiltInAsync` when applicable.
- Add the name to `Interpreter.IsBuiltIn`.
- Mirror recognition/codegen in `MaldaLang.Compiler/CSharpTranspiler.cs`.
- Update or add a focused test under `MaldaLang.Tests` with a filterable name.
- Do not assume optional vertical-pack builtins exist in this OSS core.
